# AI Rules for Antigravity-Chinese

When working on this project (translating / localizing Antigravity to Chinese), you MUST follow these guidelines:

## 1. Localization Directory
- `dicts/` contains Simplified Chinese (SC) localization dictionaries.
- Ensure all translation keys and values in `dicts/` are valid JSON and properly escaped.

## 2. Do NOT Run Installer Scripts / localization_engine.js
- You **MUST NOT** run `node localization_engine.js` or any other commands that apply/inject/install the translation to the client application.
- After finishing the dictionary changes, inform the user that changes are completed. The user will manually run `双击安装中文汉化.bat` / `.command` to install them.
